<title>HONG KONG: Ryoden Dev 1996 net down 54.09 percent.</title>
<headline>Ryoden Dev 1996 net down 54.09 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   27.51	vs 59.89</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    10.0	 vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  95.14 gain vs 422.45 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    248.44     vs 541.09</p>
<p>    Turnover		     705.95     vs 700.14</p>
<p>    Company name		 Ryoden Development Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 12-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 4</p>
<p>NOTE - Ryoden Development is a property investor and developer which also provides property management and project management services.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of long term investments in property interests.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is 14 H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of four cents) vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
